cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If microscope made a figure or an analysis in your work, please cite it
  as below.
type: software
title: "microscope: a molecular structure and spectroscopy viewer for quantum chemistry"
abstract: >-
  microscope reads the files quantum-chemistry programs write (Gaussian, ORCA
  and Q-Chem outputs, xyz, pdb, fchk, Molden and cube files) and turns them
  into 3-D structures, interactive spectra, orbitals, ChemDraw-style Lewis
  structures, and publication figures, from a viewer or from the command line.
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Bin
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-12"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lucienwb/microscope"
url: "https://lucienwb.github.io/microscope/"
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - quantum chemistry
  - molecular visualization
  - spectroscopy
